                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    CE(\mathfrak{l}(S^3))) = Sym^\bullet \langle \underset{\text{deg 3}}{\underbrace{h_3}} \rangle
            %p
              for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/minimal+Sullivan+model"} minimal Sullivan model
              of the
